Define Big-$O$, Big-$\Omega$, and Big-$\Theta$ asymptotic notations with formal mathematical definitions and graphs. Find the time complexity of the following code snippet:
```c
for(int i = 1; i <= n; i *= 2) {
    for(int j = 1; j <= n; j++) {
        // constant time operation O(1)
    }
}
```
